      "description": "<p data-start=\"426\" data-end=\"520\">Up for sale is a vintage copy of <strong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"482\">The Who – Hooligans</strong> double LP compilation on MCA Records.</p>\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"582\">Features classic tracks spanning The Who’s career including:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"719\">\n<li data-section-id=\"6wh4dj\" data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"600\">\nI Can’t Explain\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xpdjqn\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"617\">\nPinball Wizard\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"wjzqdx\" data-start=\"618\" data-end=\"632\">\nBaba O’Riley\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vamnvc\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"642\">\nBargain\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1a85h2w\" data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"658\">\nJoin Together\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fyar05\" data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"672\">\nSqueeze Box\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"24enrc\" data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"683\">\nSlip Kid\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j2cplv\" data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"690\">\n5:15\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5nd3m5\" data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"704\">\nWho Are You\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jqz3ps\" data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"719\">\nSister Disco\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"778\">Includes both original vinyl records and original sleeve.</p>\n<p data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"1043\">Vinyls show light surface wear and hairlines consistent with age and normal play. Sleeve has moderate shelf wear, edge wear, ring wear, corner wear, and some creasing/discoloration visible in photos. Overall a solid vintage copy with lots of great listening left.</p>",
